<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16733" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύγκλωστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not interwoven,
				disconnected, disjointed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράγματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cic.
					<u>Att.</u>
					6.1.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				3.18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
					<u>in Phdr.</u>
					p.187A.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξηγήσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Chr.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			; <i>incompatible,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκλώθειν τὰ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phlp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					34.14
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ ἓν ἀ. καὶ ἀσύμβατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			.</div>
